     AgiBot's X2_URDF-v1.4.0/X2-Ultra.xml (github.com/AgibotTech/agibot_x2_urdf, Mulan PSL v2).
     Changed here: the free joint is named `root`, the two head joints are fixed, the motors
     are position servos, collision is capsules and spheres, and the standing pose is the
     `init_state` keyframe. The collar is split off the torso mesh so that it can be white.
     Servo gains and the standing pose are the ones in AgiBot's x2_rl_deploy example; armature
     is the vendor file's uniform 0.03. None of the three has been identified on the robot. -->
